# This directory is the sqlx 0.7+ offline-mode query cache. Each
# `sqlx::query!` / `sqlx::query_as!` macro invocation in the workspace
# corresponds to one JSON file here, generated by `cargo sqlx prepare`.
#
# Issue #8 introduces ZERO query macros (the connection layer + healthz are
# the only deliverables), so this directory is currently empty. When #13
# lands the first real query, run:
#
#   DATABASE_URL=postgres://… cargo sqlx prepare --workspace
#
# from the repo root; it will populate this directory with the cached query
# descriptors so offline builds (e.g. CI without a live Postgres) succeed.
#
# The old single-file `sqlx-data.json` layout was removed in sqlx 0.7+.
